<title>MEXICO: Ahmsa to issue 70 mln new shrs before end of year.</title>
<headline>Ahmsa to issue 70 mln new shrs before end of year.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican steel-maker Altos Hornos de Mexico SA said on Wednesday it plans to issue some 70 million new shares before the end of the year and an additional 55 million shares next year.</p>
<p>The Monterrey-based steel giant also said its shareholders had approved a 2.5 to 1 share split.</p>
